<blockquote>
<p><strong>SCP-4416:</strong> Tails of Site-42: Why The Foundation Punches Sharks<br />
<strong>Author:</strong> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1735419&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1580933097" alt="Lt Flops" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1735419)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lt-flops" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1735419); return false;">Lt Flops</a></span></p>
</blockquote>
<hr />
<p>This is the dumbest thing I'll ever write.</p>
<p>This SCP is for <strong><a href="/draft-swap-hub">Draft Swap</a></strong>! The draft I received was from <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hotcoles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3997195); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3997195&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1580933097" alt="HotColes" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3997195)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hotcoles" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3997195); return false;">HotColes</a></span>, but I ended up writing something completely different. Without him, I wouldn't have been able to come up with this insane idea. I had a lot of fun making this, and spent a lot of time just laughing at the absurdity.</p>
<p>Oh, and this is the only article that's tagged both &quot;<strong><tt>shark-punching-center</tt></strong>&quot; and &quot;<strong><tt>dado</tt></strong>&quot;. You're welcome.</p>
